      "value": "<p>At 5th level, all of the reaper's soulsown with the arcane, divine, or primal seeds learn the speak with dead spell as a 2nd-level spell. This spell does not count toward the number of 2nd-level spells known for the purpose of the Pyramid Rule.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-reaper#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
